            <span class="mission-badge">
                Our Mission
            </span>
            <h2>
                Transforming Lives Through the
                <span>Power of Sport</span>
            </h2>
            <p>
                Fit 5 Sports Club is a trust dedicated to transforming lives
                through sports. We serve all children — typical children,
                children with intellectual and physical disabilities, and
                tribal youth — through residential camps, international
                programs, inclusive marathons, coach training, year-round
                club training, and community outreach initiatives.
            </p>

